er Swan","Silver Griffin","Silver Tower","Silver Falcon","Silver Bear","Silver Wolf","Silver Oak","Silver Key","Silver Bell","Silver Horse","Silver Heron","Silver Fox","Silver Ram","Silver Hound","Silver Chalice","Azure Hart","Azure Stag","Azure Boar","Azure Swan","Azure Griffin","Azure Tower","Azure Falcon","Azure Bear","Azure Wolf","Azure Oak","Azure Key","Azure Bell","Azure Horse","Azure Heron","Azure Fox","Azure Ram","Azure Hound","Azure Chalice","Green Hart","Green Stag","Green Boar","Green Swan","Green Griffin","Green Tower","Green Falcon","Green Bear","Green Wolf","Green Oak","Green Key","Green Bell","Green Horse","Green Heron","Green Fox","Green Ram","Green Hound","Green Chalice","Black Hart","Black Stag","Black Boar","Black Swan","Black Griffin","Black Tower","Black Falcon","Black Bear","Black Wolf","Black Oak","Black Key","Black Bell","Black Horse","Black Heron","Black Fox","Black Ram","Black Hound","Black Chalice"],"elfkof":["Silver Glade","Evening Bell","Morning Dew","Hidden Spring","Willow Crown","First Leaf","Falling Leaves","Starlit Wood","Moonlit Fern","Silent Lake","Seven Glades","Golden Bough","Singing Birch","Last Summer","White Stag","Winter Rose","Blue Heron","Long Twilight"],"desertkof":["Seven Oases","Golden Dunes","Red Sands","Glass Desert","Hundred Wells","Sun and Scarab","Bronze Sun","Salt Flats","Singing Sands","Last Oasis","Copper Sky","Nine Wells","Dawn Caravan","Painted Cliffs","Endless Dunes","Moon Oasis"],"darkkof":["Ashes","Crows","Thorns","Ravens","Silence","Ten Graves","Grey Ashes","the Long Night","the Broken Bell","the Weeping Stone","the Dead Rose","Black Briars","the Last Candle","Endless Dusk","Hollow Bells","Withered Roses","the Drowned Moon","the Nine Barrows"],"orckof":["Red Tusk","Broken Tusk","Iron Jaw","Black Fang","Bone Banner","Split Skull","Stone Fist","Rusted Axe","Bloody Moon","Ash Fang","Grey Boar","Cracked Shield","Black Boar","Burning Tusk","Gnashed Bone","Thunder Drum"],"desc":{"medieval":["a river kingdom famed for its horses","ruled by the same family for nine hundred years","a land of walled towns and wool markets","held together by marriage and old oaths","whose knights guard the mountain passes","known for its tournaments and terrible weather","where the king is chosen by the barons","rich in barley and poor in peace","a green country of orchards and abbeys","whose queen has outlived three husbands","a small kingdom with a very large army","famous for its cheese and its castles","where every lord keeps a hawk","split in two by an old inheritance quarrel","whose crown was won in a single battle","a kingdom of shepherds and stone bridges","which has never paid tribute to anyone","where the roads are safe and the taxes are not","known for its archers and its ale","a wealthy realm of vineyards and river ports","whose old king has no heir","a frontier kingdom on the edge of the forest","ruled from a castle on a lake","where the harvest fair lasts a fortnight","whose banners have flown for a thousand years","a proud kingdom that lost its capital to fire","famous for its bell-founders and clockmakers","a kingdom of chalk downs and white horses","whose princes are sent abroad to learn","where the barons are richer than the king","a quiet kingdom with a long memory","which grew rich on the salt road","whose king hunts more than he rules","known across the world for its wool","which sits between two greater powers","where every village has its own saint"],"elven":["hidden in an ancient forest","where the trees are older than the stars","ruled by a queen who never ages","which opens its borders once a century","a realm of silver rivers and singing birds","where the palaces are grown, not built","whose music can be heard for miles","which has not gone to war in a thousand years","known for its archers and its poets","where it is always early autumn","built in the branches of giant trees","lit by lanterns that never burn out","whose people speak in song","a realm of mist, moonlight and old magic","which keeps the oldest library in the world","guarded by paths that lead travellers astray","whose borders move with the seasons","ruled by a council of seven elders","where outsiders are welcome for one night only","famous for its starlit festivals","on an island no map agrees on","whose king has slept for a hundred years","which remembers the world before cities","where the river runs clear as glass","a realm of white towers among the pines","which trades only in silver and stories","whose gardens bloom in midwinter","a fading kingdom of empty halls","where every child is named by the moon","known for its healers and herb lore"],"dwarven":["carved deep beneath the mountains","famous for its forges and its feuds","whose halls run for a hundred miles","where the king is crowned on an anvil","built around a river of molten iron","rich in gold and short on patience","which has not seen daylight in centuries","known for its brewers and its stonemasons","whose gates have never been broken","ruled by a council of master smiths","which keeps its grudges written in stone","where every clan guards its own mine","whose deepest halls are now abandoned","known for its rune-carved axes","which trades steel for grain with the surface","whose great hall seats ten thousand","lit by glowing crystals and forge fires","where an oath is worth more than gold","founded on the richest silver vein ever found","ruled by a king with a beard to his boots","whose miners dug too deep","which guards a forge older than the mountains","where ale is brewed from mushrooms","whose rivals live on the other side of the mountain","famous for its engineers and its clockwork","linked to its neighbours by deep roads","whose crown is made of the first iron mined","where songs last as long as the work shift","which lost its throne room to a cave-in","known for its gem-cutters"],"desert":["built around a great oasis","whose caravans cross the endless dunes","rich in spice, salt and silk","r